      "text": "4. Prompting vs. Masking & Efficiency (Concepts 8 & 9)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. Prompting vs. Masking & Efficiency (Concepts 8 & 9)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3a2ad3f0-b44",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1920,
      "y": 245,
      "width": 483.6,
      "height": 210.60000000000002,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#052e16",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 71338,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Complementary Jobs (Never Confuse These in Defense):\n\u2022 PROMPTING (ChatML) -> Drives ACCURACY (~90%+ target):\n  Gives function signatures & descriptions so the model's\n  highest-scoring legal tokens are the semantically right ones.\n\u2022 LOGIT MASKING -> Drives VALIDITY (100% guarantee):\n  Prompting a 0.6B model for JSON fails ~70% of the time (prose\n  leaks, missing quotes). Masking makes syntax errors impossible.\n\nOnly Call the Model at True Decision Points:\n\u2022 Structural JSON ({, \", :, ,, fixed parameter keys) has zero\n  ambiguity -> Python appends them without calling the LLM.\n\u2022 Forward passes O(n^2) run ONLY for function names & values.\n\u2022 Reduces ~35-40 model calls per query down to ~5-15 calls!",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Complementary Jobs (Never Confuse These in Defense):\n\u2022 PROMPTING (ChatML) -> Drives ACCURACY (~90%+ target):\n  Gives function signatures & descriptions so the model's\n  highest-scoring legal tokens are the semantically right ones.\n\u2022 LOGIT MASKING -> Drives VALIDITY (100% guarantee):\n  Prompting a 0.6B model for JSON fails ~70% of the time (prose\n  leaks, missing quotes). Masking makes syntax errors impossible.\n\nOnly Call the Model at True Decision Points:\n\u2022 Structural JSON ({, \", :, ,, fixed parameter keys) has zero\n  ambiguity -> Python appends them without calling the LLM.\n\u2022 Forward passes O(n^2) run ONLY for function names & values.\n\u2022 Reduces ~35-40 model calls per query down to ~5-15 calls!",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
