      "text": "5. Constrained Decoding: Two Masking Paradigms (Concept 5)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. Constrained Decoding: Two Masking Paradigms (Concept 5)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "b42ddec8-157",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 705,
      "width": 483.6,
      "height": 275.40000000000003,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e2e8f0",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 18429,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PARADIGM A: Allow-List Masking (Small Enumerable Domains)\nUsed for: Function Names, Booleans, Numbers\n  masked = [-math.inf] * len(logits)\n  for tok_id in allowed_tokens:\n      masked[tok_id] = logits[tok_id]\n  next_id = masked.index(max(masked))\n\nPARADIGM B: Ban-List Masking (Open-Ended Domains)\nUsed for: Free-Text String Parameters\n  masked = list(logits)\n  for tok_id in banned_tokens:\n      masked[tok_id] = -math.inf\n  next_id = masked.index(max(masked))\n\nCRITICAL INVARIANT ('Model Chooses, Rules Bound'):\n\u2022 Rules NEVER pick the winner; rules only delete illegal options.\n\u2022 Among surviving legal tokens, the LLM's own logits pick argmax.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PARADIGM A: Allow-List Masking (Small Enumerable Domains)\nUsed for: Function Names, Booleans, Numbers\n  masked = [-math.inf] * len(logits)\n  for tok_id in allowed_tokens:\n      masked[tok_id] = logits[tok_id]\n  next_id = masked.index(max(masked))\n\nPARADIGM B: Ban-List Masking (Open-Ended Domains)\nUsed for: Free-Text String Parameters\n  masked = list(logits)\n  for tok_id in banned_tokens:\n      masked[tok_id] = -math.inf\n  next_id = masked.index(max(masked))\n\nCRITICAL INVARIANT ('Model Chooses, Rules Bound'):\n\u2022 Rules NEVER pick the winner; rules only delete illegal options.\n\u2022 Among surviving legal tokens, the LLM's own logits pick argmax.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
