      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "7. Two-Stage Generation Architecture (Concept 7)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "7. Two-Stage Generation Architecture (Concept 7)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "90278941-e5a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 705,
      "width": 505.92,
      "height": 291.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#3b0764",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 85777,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why Split Into Two Stages?\n\u2022 Building one giant grammar covering all functions and all\n  parameter combinations causes combinatorial explosion.\n\u2022 Two stages collapse uncertainty sequentially:\n\nSTAGE 1: Function Identification\n  1. Python forces: '{\"name\":\"'\n  2. Name Trie constrains tokens -> model picks 'fn_add_numbers'\n  3. Python forces: '\"'\n  => Uncertainty collapses from N functions to 1 exact FunctionSpec!\n\nSTAGE 2: Schema-Driven Parameter Infilling\n  1. Python forces: ', \"parameters\": {'\n  2. Loop over spec.parameters in exact schema order:\n     \u2022 Python forces key: '\"a\": '\n     \u2022 Dispatch value to type FSM (number -> '2.0')\n     \u2022 Python forces ', ' between parameters\n  3. Python returns structured dict -> json.dump() adds '}}'",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why Split Into Two Stages?\n\u2022 Building one giant grammar covering all functions and all\n  parameter combinations causes combinatorial explosion.\n\u2022 Two stages collapse uncertainty sequentially:\n\nSTAGE 1: Function Identification\n  1. Python forces: '{\"name\":\"'\n  2. Name Trie constrains tokens -> model picks 'fn_add_numbers'\n  3. Python forces: '\"'\n  => Uncertainty collapses from N functions to 1 exact FunctionSpec!\n\nSTAGE 2: Schema-Driven Parameter Infilling\n  1. Python forces: ', \"parameters\": {'\n  2. Loop over spec.parameters in exact schema order:\n     \u2022 Python forces key: '\"a\": '\n     \u2022 Dispatch value to type FSM (number -> '2.0')\n     \u2022 Python forces ', ' between parameters\n  3. Python returns structured dict -> json.dump() adds '}}'",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
