      "text": "8. Pydantic Runtime Type Enforcement (Concept 10)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "8. Pydantic Runtime Type Enforcement (Concept 10)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3c2120eb-494",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1195,
      "width": 691.92,
      "height": 129.60000000000002,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 16575,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Role in Architecture (src/models.py & src/registry.py):\n\u2022 Raw JSON loaded via json.load() is untyped (dict[str, Any]).\n\u2022 FunctionSpec(BaseModel) enforces typed fields at the system boundary:\n    name: str | description: str = '' | parameters: dict[str, dict[str, Any]] | returns: dict\n\u2022 Catches missing/wrong-typed schema attributes immediately via ValidationError\n  instead of crashing deep inside decoding loops.\n\u2022 Belt-and-suspenders guarantee: input schema is validated at load time, and output\n  payload structure is assembled deterministically in Python.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Role in Architecture (src/models.py & src/registry.py):\n\u2022 Raw JSON loaded via json.load() is untyped (dict[str, Any]).\n\u2022 FunctionSpec(BaseModel) enforces typed fields at the system boundary:\n    name: str | description: str = '' | parameters: dict[str, dict[str, Any]] | returns: dict\n\u2022 Catches missing/wrong-typed schema attributes immediately via ValidationError\n  instead of crashing deep inside decoding loops.\n\u2022 Belt-and-suspenders guarantee: input schema is validated at load time, and output\n  payload structure is assembled deterministically in Python.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7448de08-c85",
      "type": "rectangle",
