      "text": "9. Defensive Error Handling & Edge Cases (Concept 11)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "9. Defensive Error Handling & Edge Cases (Concept 11)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fdfad319-8bd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 870,
      "y": 1195,
      "width": 602.64,
      "height": 145.8,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#450a0a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 43736,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Zero Raw Stack Traces Policy (Context Managers + Try/Except):\n\u2022 Missing File -> catches FileNotFoundError, prints clean path diagnostic.\n\u2022 Corrupt JSON -> catches json.JSONDecodeError, exits gracefully.\n\u2022 Malformed Function Entry -> skips invalid item with warning; keeps valid ones.\n\u2022 Empty Registry -> select_function_name() raises ValueError (caught per-prompt).\n\u2022 Empty Prompt -> build_prompt() raises ValueError (isolated in batch loop).\n\u2022 Empty Parameters ({}) -> loop runs 0 times; emits valid 'parameters': {}.\n\u2022 Bad Number Cast -> ValueError falls back safely to 0 (int) or 0.0 (float).\n\u2022 Ctrl+C -> caught in __main__.py for clean 'Interrupted by user' exit.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Zero Raw Stack Traces Policy (Context Managers + Try/Except):\n\u2022 Missing File -> catches FileNotFoundError, prints clean path diagnostic.\n\u2022 Corrupt JSON -> catches json.JSONDecodeError, exits gracefully.\n\u2022 Malformed Function Entry -> skips invalid item with warning; keeps valid ones.\n\u2022 Empty Registry -> select_function_name() raises ValueError (caught per-prompt).\n\u2022 Empty Prompt -> build_prompt() raises ValueError (isolated in batch loop).\n\u2022 Empty Parameters ({}) -> loop runs 0 times; emits valid 'parameters': {}.\n\u2022 Bad Number Cast -> ValueError falls back safely to 0 (int) or 0.0 (float).\n\u2022 Ctrl+C -> caught in __main__.py for clean 'Interrupted by user' exit.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
