      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Key Design Tradeoffs Worth Explaining:\n1. String Drift vs. Regex Expressiveness: string.py treats '.' and '\\\\' as soft\n   drift terminators to prevent JSON leakage, which can truncate complex regexes\n   early (e.g. '\\d+'). Post-processing also normalizes '\\\\\\\\' -> '\\'.\n2. Digit-by-Digit Numbers: Allowing single-char '0-9' tokens guarantees valid\n   numeric syntax at the cost of splitting multi-digit tokens into single steps.\n3. Vocab Scan Cost: Scanning ~151k vocab tokens in string.py per string call is\n   O(|V|); caching banned_strings & banned_drifts once at startup eliminates it.\n4. No KV-Cache in SDK: Skipping model calls on static JSON keeps latency low.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Key Design Tradeoffs Worth Explaining:\n1. String Drift vs. Regex Expressiveness: string.py treats '.' and '\\\\' as soft\n   drift terminators to prevent JSON leakage, which can truncate complex regexes\n   early (e.g. '\\d+'). Post-processing also normalizes '\\\\\\\\' -> '\\'.\n2. Digit-by-Digit Numbers: Allowing single-char '0-9' tokens guarantees valid\n   numeric syntax at the cost of splitting multi-digit tokens into single steps.\n3. Vocab Scan Cost: Scanning ~151k vocab tokens in string.py per string call is\n   O(|V|); caching banned_strings & banned_drifts once at startup eliminates it.\n4. No KV-Cache in SDK: Skipping model calls on static JSON keeps latency low.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
